error[T-Bound]: `Self.Iter.Item` requires `Discardable`, and `S.Iter.Item` does not have that capability
  --> tests/iter/operations/a_generic_filter_needs_its_items_discardable.lin:16:12
   |
16 |     values.filter(|value| value.heavy()).fold(0, |sink total, sink _value| total + 1)
   |            ^^^^^^ `filter` may dispose of an `S.Iter.Item`, so it requires the type to be Discardable; give the value to an operation that keeps it, or settle it before
  ::: std/iter/iter.lin
L  |         Self.Iter.Item: Discardable
   |         -------------- required by this `where` clause
